   "q": "<div class=\"box\"><p>Last Saturday, Bora wanted to call his friend Taner to invite him to a football match. He dialled the number in his old notebook, but a woman answered. “Sorry, you've got the wrong number,” she said. Bora apologised and hung up. Then he texted Taner's brother, Can, and asked for Taner's new number. Can wrote back: “He changed it last month. Here it is.” Bora called the new number at once, but the line was busy. Ten minutes later, Taner called him back and said he would love to come.</p></div><p>According to the text, which of the following is <b>CORRECT</b>?</p>",
