   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Ada:</b> Hi, is Selin there?</div><div><b>Selin's mother:</b> ----</div><div><b>Ada:</b> OK. Could you tell her that Ada called?</div></div><p>Which of the following can <b>NOT</b> complete the conversation?</p>",
