   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<div class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 230\" width=\"520\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"CityGas customer line menu\">\n<rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"516\" height=\"226\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"10\" width=\"496\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f766e\"/>\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CITYGAS CUSTOMER LINE · 444 08 55</text>\n<text x=\"26\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\">“Welcome to CityGas. Please choose from the following options.”</text>\n<g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\">\n<rect x=\"26\" y=\"82\" width=\"26\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#0f766e\"/><text x=\"39\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"98\">New gas connection for a home</text>\n<rect x=\"26\" y=\"110\" width=\"26\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#0f766e\"/><text x=\"39\" y=\"126\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"126\">Bills and payments</text>\n<rect x=\"26\" y=\"138\" width=\"26\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><text x=\"39\" y=\"154\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"154\">Gas leak or emergency (24 hours)</text>\n<rect x=\"26\" y=\"166\" width=\"26\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#0f766e\"/><text x=\"39\" y=\"182\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"182\">Moving house / changing your address</text>\n<rect x=\"26\" y=\"194\" width=\"26\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#475569\"/><text x=\"39\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"210\">Speak to an operator</text>\n</g>\n</svg></div><p>Four people call CityGas. Which of them presses the <b>WRONG</b> number?</p>",
