   "q": "<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Doruk:</b> Hi Grandma! Can you hear me? I'm on the ferry.</div><div><b>Grandma:</b> Doruk? Your voice is coming and going.</div><div><b>Doruk:</b> Sorry, the signal is weak here. Is it better now?</div><div><b>Grandma:</b> A little. Speak up, dear. The engine is so loud!</div><div><b>Doruk:</b> I said I'll be at your house at six! Oh no, my battery is at two percent. I'll call you from Uncle Ali's phone when I get off the ferry.</div></div><p>Why is Doruk going to call his grandmother from his uncle's phone?</p>",
