   "q": "<div class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 220\" width=\"540\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Staff board at Mavi Tour office\">\n<rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"536\" height=\"216\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"10\" width=\"516\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\"/>\n<text x=\"270\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">MAVİ TOUR · STAFF BOARD · Today</text>\n<g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\">\n<text x=\"26\" y=\"68\" font-weight=\"bold\">Name</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"68\" font-weight=\"bold\">Department</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"68\" font-weight=\"bold\">Where?</text>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/>\n<text x=\"26\" y=\"100\">Mr. Aydın</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"100\">Sales</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"100\">In a meeting (until 14:30)</text>\n<text x=\"26\" y=\"130\">Ms. Koç</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"130\">Accounts</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"130\">Lunch break (back at 13:30)</text>\n<text x=\"26\" y=\"160\">Mr. Ekin</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"160\">IT</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"160\">On holiday (back on Monday)</text>\n<text x=\"26\" y=\"190\">Ms. Tan</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"190\">Design</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"190\">Working from home (mobile only)</text>\n</g>\n</svg></div><p>It is <b>13:45</b> now. The receptionist at Mavi Tour looks at the board when people call the <b>office line</b>. Which caller will most probably hear “Hold on, please. I'll put you through.”?</p>",
